    Bug 2001602 - Remove nsMsgCompose::AttachmentPrettyName(). r=tobyp


    Pretty rare need.
    For http url only attachments, the most common case is Attach | Web page.
    Notice it doesn't handle httpS either... I think it's fine to have the name display the raw URL in such cases.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D274585

